## Core Implementation

**Kafka Configuration:**
```java
Properties props = new Properties();
props.put(ProducerConfig.ENABLE_IDEMPOTENCE_CONFIG, true);
props.put(ProducerConfig.TRANSACTIONAL_ID_CONFIG, "pipeline-" + UUID.randomUUID());
